    "narrative": "As we navigate the final stretch of the season, **Sam Antonacci** headlines our active lineup today with an efficiency score of 58.38. His status as a leadoff hitter against Blubaugh provides a significant boost, and the platoon advantage (vs RHP) pushes him to the top of our daily hierarchy. While **Miguel Vargas** also draws a favorable matchup against Blubaugh, his score of 50.48 is tempered slightly by park factors and a lower platoon efficiency compared to **Sam Antonacci**. Elsewhere, **Jackson Merrill** (53.09) and **Drake Baldwin** (47.58) provide consistent, albeit lower-ceiling output; **Jackson Merrill** faces a mid-tier arm in Boyd, and while the matchup isn't ideal, his elite command of the strike zone and presence in the heart of the order keep him firmly in the mix despite the threat of an elite hold pitcher. **Heliot Ramos** (46.77) rounds out the UTIL spot, benefiting from a neutral platoon edge against Tolle, though he remains a marginal play as we monitor his recent contact quality.\n\nThe bench remains heavy with stars like **Kyle Tucker**, **Gunnar Henderson**, and **Vladimir Guerrero Jr.**, all of whom are sidelined today due to team off-days. With **Luis Robert Jr.** officially on the IL, our decision-making has focused on maximizing efficiency within our limited available depth. The most interesting \"near-miss\" in today's projection was **Drake Baldwin**; his score was heavily influenced by his spot in the lineup, but he barely edged out our deeper reserve options like **Nasim Nunez** or **Brayan Rocchio** who might have offered more speed-based upside had they been confirmed for starts. We are proceeding with caution regarding the SP skill levels\u2014specifically against Luzardo\u2014which has suppressed the ceiling for **Drake Baldwin**. Ensure monitoring of the lineup cards, as any late-game defensive substitutions or weather shifts could necessitate a swap to prioritize high-sprint-speed options like **Nasim Nunez** if we find ourselves chasing stolen bases late in the evening.",
